navmesh-rs is an altered, translated version of recastnavigation
(https://github.com/recastnavigation/recastnavigation) at upstream commit
9f4ce64458dfae86e1239c525ddc219c4e9e06f1. It is not the original software.
Our changes and additions are licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-MIT,
LICENSE-APACHE). The recastnavigation licence is reproduced below unaltered.

The zlib licence below covers all translated sources and headers listed here.

Translated crowd sources: DetourCrowd.cpp, DetourPathCorridor.cpp,
DetourLocalBoundary.cpp, DetourObstacleAvoidance.cpp, DetourProximityGrid.cpp,
DetourPathQueue.cpp and their public headers (DetourCrowd/Source and Include).

Translated tile-cache sources: DetourTileCache.cpp, DetourTileCacheBuilder.cpp
and their public headers (DetourTileCache/Source and Include).
No FastLZ source is included; the supplied compressor stores raw grids.

